    {
      "source": "Expects the same syntax as Locale's <code>toString()</code>, i.e. language +\noptionally country + optionally variant, separated by \"_\" (for example, \"en\", \"en_US\").\nAlso accepts spaces as separators, as an alternative to underscores.",
      "translation": "期望与 `Locale` 的 `<code>toString()</code>` 相同的语法，即语言 + 可选的国家 + 可选的变体，用 \"_\" 分隔（例如，\"en\"、\"en_US\"）。也接受空格作为分隔符，作为下划线的替代方案。",
      "count": 2
    },
